[02:41.72]Why did we come to this place?
[02:43.85]Splotches of snow, unpleasantly cold, stick to the face
[02:47.24]Colored onions sprout above but we just keep pushing the pace
[02:50.00]tread in our boots, pushing the pace
[02:52.18]Ever since I could remember we’ve been chained to these skis
[02:55.37]do as they please
[02:56.54]Fly off a ramp and bloody our knees
[02:58.41]Treat the wound but not the disease
[02:59.95]But now we seek a cure
[03:01.52]And in this stone of white rests a cozy little store
[03:04.16]Give the gate a push, sneak inside a warm wooden cottage
[03:06.44]Pick a bench, you don’t need a number
[03:09.00]Or be a member, have some honey and tea
[03:11.04]Be sure to let it steep
[03:12.66]When you taste the difference you will find a way to be free from the
[03:14.80]Bouncers and judges, hypnotists, sensationalists
[03:17.91]Playing silly games to keep us on track so we forget
[03:21.27]Everybody ends up at the same final stop
[03:23.63]Gotta get a handle on tuning your own clock
[03:26.85]谁在等候
[03:29.32]满脸的期待 像一串问号
[03:37.38]平行宇宙
